{"id": "unknown-2026-09-30-006", "date": "2026-09-30", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 9, "week": 40, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["oled_penetration"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "O-Vision (Aoshi) Technology progresses with its 12-inch OLED microdisplay line in Hangzhou", "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/aoshi-technology-o-vision-technology\">O-vision (Aoshi) Technology</a> announced that it has received the permit from the local government of Zhejiang province, to go ahead with its plan to build its 12-inch OLED microdisplay fab in Hangzhou. O-Vision Aoshi will also build its new headquarters and a new R&amp;D center in the same location.</p><img width=\"875\" data-entity-uuid=\"1878f135-4ea5-4446-82c3-0439b8347713\" data-entity-type=\"file\" src=\"https://www.oled", "sources": [{"name": "oled_info", "url": "https://www.oled-info.com/o-vision-aoshi-technology-progresses-its-12-inch-oled-microdisplay-line", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "lg_elec-2026-09-30-007", "date": "2026-09-30", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 9, "week": 40, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": ["lg_elec"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["oled_penetration"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "LG Electronics to develop a next-gen large-screen OLED and LCD based display for Porsche", "content": "<p>According to reports from Korea, LG Electronics and Porsche are co-developing a next-generation large-screen display for Porsche's future cars. The project is funded (at least partially) by the Korean Ministry of Trade, Industry and Energy (MTIE). &nbsp;</p><div class=\"align-center\">\n  \n  <a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/sites/default/files/2025-10/Porsche-Cayenne-Electric-Flow-OLED.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">\n    \n    <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.oled-info.com/sites/default/files/styles/", "sources": [{"name": "oled_info", "url": "https://www.oled-info.com/lg-electronics-develop-next-gen-large-screen-oled-and-lcd-based-display-porsche", "type": "rss"}]}
